From c4433a33bbcae1639f4c391700f37278875c8da9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Ruijl <ben@ruijl.ch>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 05:53:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Accelerate rational polynomial kernels and preserve
 constant contexts

Delegate guarded rational polynomial multiplication and exact division to integer-domain kernels, avoid redundant fraction normalization, and remove the dense i128 representation cliff. Add exact regression and boundary tests; preserve constant variable maps and omit zero partial-fraction terms.
